<Base title="About | Secure Scaffolding" description="Secure Scaffolding is an Australian-owned Sydney scaffolding company with a track record spanning major projects." current="about"><main><PageHeader eyebrow="Our story" title="Experience you can build on." intro="Proudly Australian-owned and based in Sydney, Secure Scaffolding has delivered dependable access solutions since 1996." /><section class="section" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap about-story"><div><p class="lead">Secure Scaffolding Pty Ltd was founded in 1996 as a labour hire company with just two crews of scaffolders. By early 1997, we were entrusted with the Wood Chopping Arena and Horticultural Building at the New Sydney Showgrounds for Hansen Yuncken. We also partnered with AW Edwards for scaffold and rigging works, rapidly growing our workforce to 24 skilled professionals.</p><p class="lead">By 2000, we had completed all unit blocks in the Olympic Village for Mirvac Constructions and many other significant projects for major builders. Our team expanded to 40 scaffolders, including eight contracted to the French company Nussli to build the Volleyball Stadium at Bondi Beach for the Sydney Olympics. After this, Nussli offered us opportunities for international work.</p><p class="lead">Post-Olympics, Secure Scaffolding continued its upward trajectory, securing contracts with major companies such as Boral, PCH, Mirvac and Multiplex. We also commenced the retrofit of the athletes’ village with Newington Homes.</p><p class="lead">In 2001, we won the first stage of post-Olympic housing, delivering 45 homes. From that point forward, we secured every housing contract for the project, which was completed in November 2008, with a contract value exceeding $10 million.</p><p class="lead">That same year, we expanded into scaffolding hire and transportation services with the launch of Secure Domestic Safety Access Pty Ltd.</p><p class="lead">In 2024, we rebranded as Secure Scaffolding Services Pty Ltd, continuing our dedication to excellence while steadily enhancing our services. Since the rebrand, we have continued expanding and growing the business, welcoming more team members and working with more builders and construction partners in the Greater Sydney, Central Coast and Newcastle area. Today, we bring together experienced people, dependable equipment and practical site coordination to support commercial, industrial, civil, infrastructure, residential and health projects.</p><p class="lead">We remain committed to the same high standards of reliability that have defined our company for decades, while continuing to build the team and builder relationships that will shape our next stage of growth.</p></div><div class="list"><div class="list-row">1996 <span>Company founded</span></div><div class="list-row">1997 <span>New Sydney Showgrounds & AW Edwards</span></div><div class="list-row">2000 <span>Sydney Olympics projects</span></div><div class="list-row">2008 <span>45 post-Olympic homes completed</span></div><div class="list-row">2024 <span>Rebranded as Secure Scaffolding Services</span></div><div class="list-row">Today <span>Growing our team and builder partnerships</span></div></div></div></section><section class="section band"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow" style="color:#d7f54b">Project record</div><h2>Work that tells the story.</h2></div><p class="lead">From bridges and hospitals to commercial and residential sites, our experience spans the environments where safe access matters most.</p></div><ProjectGallery /></div></section></main></Base>
